IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. ROUTESEL.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 SQLCODE PIC S9(9) COMP VALUE ZERO.
LINKAGE SECTION.
01 ROUTE-PRODUCT PIC X(8).
01 ROUTE-DATE PIC 9(8).
01 ROUTE-OUTPUT PIC X(8).
COPY ERRAREA.
PROCEDURE DIVISION USING ROUTE-PRODUCT ROUTE-DATE
    ROUTE-OUTPUT ERROR-AREA.
SELECT-CALCULATOR.
    MOVE SPACES TO ROUTE-OUTPUT.
    EXEC SQL
        SELECT PROGRAM_NAME
          INTO :ROUTE-OUTPUT
          FROM ROUTE_CONFIG
         WHERE PRODUCT_CODE = :ROUTE-PRODUCT
           AND EFFECTIVE_FROM <= :ROUTE-DATE
           AND EFFECTIVE_TO >= :ROUTE-DATE
    END-EXEC.
    IF SQLCODE NOT = ZERO
        MOVE 'ROUTE-LOOKUP' TO ERROR-STAGE
        EVALUATE SQLCODE
            WHEN 100
                MOVE 71 TO PROCESS-STATUS
                MOVE 'ROUTE-MISSING' TO ERROR-CODE
            WHEN -811
                MOVE 72 TO PROCESS-STATUS
                MOVE 'ROUTE-AMBIGUOUS' TO ERROR-CODE
            WHEN OTHER
                MOVE 73 TO PROCESS-STATUS
                MOVE 'ROUTE-DATABASE-ERROR' TO ERROR-CODE
        END-EVALUATE
    END-IF.
    IF PROCESS-STATUS = ZERO AND ROUTE-OUTPUT = SPACES
        MOVE 74 TO PROCESS-STATUS
        MOVE 'ROUTE-LOOKUP' TO ERROR-STAGE
        MOVE 'ROUTE-PROGRAM-BLANK' TO ERROR-CODE
    END-IF.
    GOBACK.
